{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/i18n/effect","title":"i18n with Effect","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"i18n-with-effect","children":[{"t":"text","text":"i18n with Effect"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/i18n-effect"},{"t":"text","text":" is an "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"adapter, and only an adapter"}]},{"t":"text","text":". It exposes three"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"things — a service tag, a "},{"t":"code","text":"Layer"},{"t":"text","text":", and one function — over a runtime you built"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the ordinary way. "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/i18n"},{"t":"text","text":" itself never imports Effect, and plain"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component code should keep calling "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":" directly."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-layer","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The Layer"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { Effect } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'effect'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideI18nRuntime, translateEffect } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/i18n-effect'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"runtime"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"createI18nRuntime","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ locales, defaultLocale: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'en-US'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// One Layer, built from the runtime the rest of the app already uses.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i18nLayer"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"provideI18nRuntime","kind":"function"},{"text":"(runtime);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideI18nRuntime(runtime)"},{"t":"text","text":" returns "},{"t":"code","text":"Layer.Layer<I18nEffectService>"},{"t":"text","text":". It wraps"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the runtime you already have, so there is exactly one active locale in the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"process — the Effect side does not get its own."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"bind-the-locales-once","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Bind the locales once"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"translateEffect"},{"t":"text","text":" has no value parameter carrying the locales, so TypeScript has"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nothing to infer them from. Called bare, its key parameter resolves to "},{"t":"code","text":"never"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"even a valid key is rejected"}]},{"t":"text","text":". Bind them once, in the same file as the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Layer:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { TranslationKey, TranslationParams } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/i18n'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"AppLocales","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"typeof","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" locales;","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"/**","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" * `translateEffect` has no value parameter carrying the locales, so TypeScript","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" * cannot infer them: called bare, its key parameter resolves to `never` and","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" * even a valid key is rejected. Bind them once, here, and every call site gets","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" * the closed key union back.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":" */","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"t","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" <","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"Key","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"extends","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"TranslationKey","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"AppLocales","kind":"type"},{"text":"[","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"number","kind":"type"},{"text":"]>>(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"key"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Key","kind":"type"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"params"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"keyof","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"TranslationParams","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"AppLocales","kind":"type"},{"text":"[","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"number","kind":"type"},{"text":"],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"Key","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"&","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"string","kind":"type"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  > ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"extends","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"never","kind":"type"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"?","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"params"},{"text":"?","kind":"keyword"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"TranslationParams","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"AppLocales","kind":"type"},{"text":"[","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"number","kind":"type"},{"text":"], ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"Key","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"&","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"string","kind":"type"},{"text":">]","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"params"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"TranslationParams","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"AppLocales","kind":"type"},{"text":"[","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"number","kind":"type"},{"text":"], ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"Key","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"&","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"string","kind":"type"},{"text":">]","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"translateEffect","kind":"function"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"AppLocales","kind":"type"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"Key","kind":"type"},{"text":">(key, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"params);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"From there, "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":" has the closed key union and the typed params back. Passing the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"type arguments at every call site —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"translateEffect<typeof locales, 'order.total'>(…)"},{"t":"text","text":" — works too, and is what"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"this wrapper spares you."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"translateeffect","children":[{"t":"code","text":"translateEffect"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// Same keys, same params, same string as runtime.t — but as an Effect that","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// declares I18nEffectService in its requirements.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"summary"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" Effect.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"gen","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"total"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"t","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'order.total'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { amount: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1234.5","kind":"number"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"items"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"t","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'order.items'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { count: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"total","kind":"string"},{"text":"} ${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"items","kind":"string"},{"text":"}`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The signature is "},{"t":"code","text":"translateEffect(key, params) => Effect.Effect<string, never, I18nEffectService>"},{"t":"text","text":". Same closed key union, same"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"typed params, same string as "},{"t":"code","text":"runtime.t"},{"t":"text","text":" — the snippet above is checked against"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"runtime.t"},{"t":"text","text":" in the docs test suite rather than trusted."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The error channel is "},{"t":"code","text":"never"},{"t":"text","text":" on purpose: a translation that reaches this point"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"cannot fail on a bad key or a bad parameter, because neither compiles. What"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"can"}]},{"t":"text","text":" fail is the locale not being loaded, and that is a defect in the app's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"startup, which is why it throws "},{"t":"code","text":"I18nRuntimeError"},{"t":"text","text":" rather than becoming a typed"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failure every call site would have to handle."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"when-to-reach-for-it","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When to reach for it"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"translateEffect"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"inside an Effect program"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — a domain service building a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"message, a server handler rendering an email. In a component, the bound"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"translator is the shorter path, and reaching for Effect just to format a string"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"adds a requirement to the program for nothing."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An Effect program is not a Craft injection context, so "},{"t":"code","text":"translateEffect"},{"t":"text","text":" accepts"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"StaticTranslationKey"},{"t":"text","text":" — the keys whose formatting resolves no service. A"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"message whose token yields a Craft service is rendered by the component-side"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"translator; that is what keeps the "},{"t":"code","text":"never"},{"t":"text","text":" error channel above honest."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See also the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/advanced/effect","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effect adapters"}]},{"t":"text","text":" page for the rest of the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/*-effect"},{"t":"text","text":" family."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"the-layer","text":"The Layer"},{"level":2,"id":"bind-the-locales-once","text":"Bind the locales once"},{"level":2,"id":"translateeffect","text":"translateEffect"},{"level":2,"id":"when-to-reach-for-it","text":"When to reach for it"}]}